msgstr "Lista de canales"

#. Status message when a mode list (bans, invites, exceptions) the user asked for came back with no entries. {kind} is the list's name as an English word inserted by the app ('Ban list', 'Invite list', 'Exception list'); the matching kind keys are list.kindBans/list.kindInvites/list.kindExcepts.
#: client/js/irc/handlers/lists.ts
msgctxt "list.isEmpty"
